of God: \ft Not included in some manuscripts.\ef*.\fthe Apostle to the Philippians
\c 4
\p
\v 1 Therefore, my beloved brothers whom I long for, my joy and crown, in this way stand firm in the Lord, beloved friends.
\s5
\c 1
\p
\v 1 Paul and Timothy, servants of Christ Jesus, to all the ones set apart in Christ Jesus who are at Philippi, with the overseers and deacons.
\v 2 Grace to you and peace from God o + \fr 1.1 \ft Some manuscripts do
not have \fq the Son of God.\f*
\v 2 \ef - \fr 1.2: \fk Prophet\ef*It began as the prophet Isaiah had written\ef - \fr 1.2:
