from Ex 23.20, “Someone is shouting in the desert, ‘Get the road ready for the Lord; make
a straight path for our God to travel!’ ”.\ef*:\x - \xo 1.2: \xt Mal 3.1\x*
\q1 “God said, ‘I will send my messengep
